# ADR-0001: Duplicate Metadata

* **Status**: Accepted
* **Date**: 2026-10-21

<!-- semedit-adr-metadata:v1 keys=summary,description,role,scope,area,languages; do not change key names or order. -->
| Key | Value |
| :--- | :--- |
| summary | Reject duplicate metadata rows. |
| description | Keep the schema unambiguous. |
| role | contract |
| scope | documentation |
| area | generic |
| languages | generic |
| role | principle |

## Context

Metadata rows must follow the fixed schema.

## Decision

Reject duplicate metadata rows.

## Invariants

The schema is unambiguous.

## Consequences

Invalid ADRs do not produce search results.
